---
// A persistent, accessible reminder that the site is not for emergencies.
---

<aside
  class="bg-alert-700 text-cream-50"
  role="note"
  aria-label="Emergency notice"
>
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 py-2 text-center text-sm">
    In a crisis or emergency? Call <a href="tel:911" class="font-semibold underline">911</a>
    or call/text the 988 Suicide &amp; Crisis Lifeline at
    <a href="tel:988" class="font-semibold underline">988</a>.
    <a href="/crisis" class="font-semibold underline">More crisis resources →</a>
  </div>
</aside>
